# Architecture and code quality

Detail: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) sections "Architecture that exists" and "Code".

- UnMaker Lab authors and extracts. Maker Engine places and plays. Do not delete Maker blueprint editors until a tested UnMaker path replaces them.
- Extend `anim.rs` and the project JSON. Do not add a second sprite system. Do not put API keys or ROM bytes in the project.
- New behavior is a data graph. Patrol and jump labels are not a second physics model. Godot does not play Phase 9 clips.
- Keep new logic in a focused module. Do not keep growing `app.rs` when a module can own it.
- Serde defaults for new fields so old projects open. Explicit errors. Deterministic play steps. No new dependency unless the workspace cannot do the job.
- `unsafe` needs a stated reason. Do not reformat the eight historical fmt-fail files unless the task is about that file.
- Comment why: NES timing, collision, migrations, security limits, known gaps. Describe implemented behavior, not a plan, in docs.
